{"id":"n24017-1-9","stage":3,"title":"괴롭히다 · 欺负","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24017-1-9-1","ko":"오늘따라 왜 이렇게 피곤해 보여?","zh":"今天怎么看起来这么累啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"피곤해","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피곤해","audio":"/audio/658f643097f32b8076bb.mp3"}},{"text":"보여?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9517713c9509972825a0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24017-1-9-2","ko":"밤새 모기가 괴롭혀서 잠을 못 잤어.","zh":"一整晚都被蚊子烦得睡不着觉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밤새","meaning":"整晚，整夜","explanation":"밤새：整晚，整夜","readings":[{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15467","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}},{"text":"모기가","meaning":"蚊子","explanation":"모기：蚊子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모기","audio":"/audio/4e61f16053103ba4a929.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55757","senseId":"1","lemma":"모기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모기가","audio":"/audio/161b7537804ad25f3fbc.mp3"}},{"text":"괴롭혀서","meaning":"欺负，折磨","explanation":"괴롭히다：欺负，折磨；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"괴롭히다","audio":"/audio/ebfb6410b7e12a3d0742.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24017","senseId":"1","lemma":"괴롭히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괴롭혀서","audio":"/audio/b538e987d9ada997ca26.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","ori